Well I wasn't going to enter into this madness, but...

The other day I stepped on a pool and died.  This was surprising because I
could teleport (and wasn't on a special level).  Subsequent testing revealed
that I died about 75% of the time and teleported about a quarter of the
time.  Please tell me that this is a bug and is fixed. (I'm using the
PC 3.0.7 from linc...).  It's not some twisted feature of HARD, is it?

